<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Gibson forms j/v with Chemetall.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Gibson forms j/v with Chemetall.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemical and plastics maker Gibson Chemical Industries Ltd said on Wednesday it had formed a joint venture with Chemetall GmbH, a unit of German metals and trading group Metallgesellschaft AG.</p>
<p>&quot;The new company, to be named Gibson Chemetall Pty Ltd, will engage in the manufacture of chemicals used in preparing metal and plastic surfaces for final coating,&quot; Gibson said.</p>
<p>&quot;The present metal-finishing products business of Gibson Chemicals, which has successfully operated in Australia for many years, has been transferred to the joint venture,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
